          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On April 20, 2008, a passenger in a car took pictures of clouds through the windshield. While reviewing the photos, she noticed a spot that intrigued her and that she hadn't seen at the time of the taking. It remains difficult to analyze photos showing unexplained spots without visual observation to confirm them. A defect on the windshield or an insect could also explain the spot: we lack more precise information for this case.",
